Modifications by Doctrine
-------------------------
The copies in this directory are NOT byte-identical to upstream. The book
sources from upstream src/ are vendored here under their upstream file names,
taken from branch master on 2026-09-08 when its HEAD was
97a0969cb07fe4cabb0eed8a56234053f47d83dc (2025-07-08), with two deterministic
link transforms applied at import:

  mdbook-chapter-links     Rewrites the 59 cross-chapter links that mdBook
                           generates as "naming.html#c-case" into
                           "naming.md#c-case", so navigation works when the
                           sources are read as plain files.

  rustdoc-std-relocations  Repoints two links in naming.md from
                           std/sync/atomic/struct.AtomicBool.html, which now
                           returns 404, to struct.Atomic.html, which carries
                           the referenced method anchors.

No prose was changed. Both transforms are implemented in
../../scripts/check_vendored.py and declared per file in
../UPSTREAM.json, which also records the sha256 of the untouched upstream
download (upstream_sha256) beside the sha256 of the file on disk. Under
Apache-2.0 section 4(b) a change notice would be required if this material
were redistributed under that option; this file serves as that notice.

Upstream ships no NOTICE file (verified: GitHub contents API returns 404 for
rust-lang/api-guidelines/NOTICE), so Apache-2.0 section 4(d) imposes no
further obligation.

